Package: tokenbridge
Type: Package
Title: TokenBridge Client for Health API Research
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jack", "Manners", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "jack@example.com")
Description: Lightweight client for fetching health data via a TokenBridge
    deployment. TokenBridge handles OAuth token management; this package
    provides the R interface for auth URLs, token retrieval, and health data
    fetching. Currently supports Google Health API (Fitbit-backed), with
    Withings support planned.
